Implement DataWriter in the private Wine 10.20 Windows.Storage build.
Requires 0018-memory-stream.patch. No global module or package replacement.

Provides IDataWriterFactory, buffer-only activation, primitive and string
serialization, independent byte buffering, detach/close, and StoreAsync
adapted to the output stream's actual completion. Preserves short-write tails
and propagates errors/cancellation. Flush forwards to the associated stream.
Includes ABI tests with controlled delayed/error/short-write streams and a
full-size BMP byte round-trip through the memory stream.

